   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Groundbreaking Efficiency for Your Grinding Shop </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">The greatest potential for efficiency lies outside the grinding machine: ZOLLER Solutions are your key to the future—we help you achieve greater success. After all, those who manufacture faster and more efficiently operate more cost-effectively, enabling them to invest in the future. If economic progress is your goal, then ZOLLER is your partner.</p>",
   "images": [],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "text",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c2030",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "extra-large",
    "after": "extra-large"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "cols",
   "layout": "33-66",
   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h2> Software functions </h2>",
      "body": "<h4>For Maximum Performance</h4>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c2028",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "360° Concentricity Check",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>To automatically determine the radial run-out of circular surfaces (e.g., tool shanks) and graphically evaluate the entire contour.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/4/csm_software_rundlaufpruefung_074ba05353.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2047",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Point angle with hollow grinding",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>For drills and hollow-ground tools, this is determined by contour tracking from the start point (major diameter) to the tool tip or the defined end point.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/8/csm_software_spitzewinkel_f7d99885f3.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2045",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Groove chip space scan",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Automatically scans the groove/chip space contour without contact and represents it graphically.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/c/csm_software_nutscan_4a0f6866e5.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2043",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Radius »Contour« with Graphic",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>For the automatic determination of concave and convex radii on the outer contour of tools, including adjustable angular sectors with graphic evaluation.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/0/csm_software_radiuskontur_f2b805a005.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2041",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Rake angle on radius cutters",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Calculates the rake angle within the Radius segment based on the specified angles. Suitable for the cutters, corner cutters and full radius cutters.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/5/csm_software_spanwinkel_1e858e188a.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2039",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Contour profile measurement (»lasso«)«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>To scan any tool or workpiece contours and perform a nominal/actual comparison or dimension the contour.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/f/csm_software_lasso_2774d358f7.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2037",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "»Metis« Tool Analysis",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Measures and documents any contours, radii, angles, distances, and defects (wear and tear) using incident light.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/2/csm_software_metis_75f5607842.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2035",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Editable »apus« inspection report",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>To represent all measurement results—including designations, nominal values, tolerances, and much more—in a table format with a flexible layout.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/e/csm_software_apus_d369f092b1.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2033",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "ZOLLER »caz«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The virtual measuring machine for the PC workplace, used to externally configure the testing and measurement sequence—including measuring programs, nominal values, and tolerances—based on the 3D model of the tool, even before it is manufactured.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/5/csm_software_caz_99dbbf50e2.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2031",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
